aca.org/cbss/VZQCNYXE" ref="dc:subject"><desc>translations from Greek</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/VZQCNYXE" ref="dc:subject"><desc>translations into Georgian</desc></relation></listRelation></body></text></TEI>